# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Orgrimmar -> zeppelin to the Undercity (Apothecary Zinge, training) -> zeppelin to Grom'gol
# -> Zul'Mamwe for Gan'zulah -> Grom'gol (the Fate of Yenniku) -> fly to Booty Bay (the Bloodsail
# chain, the Wild Shore, the ships) -> Mistvale Valley (Unbagwa and Mokk, the gorillas) -> Booty Bay
# -> Zanzil's camps and the pirate ghosts -> the Ironjaw basilisks -> Grom'gol -> the naga shore
# and the Holy Spring -> Booty Bay -> fly to Grom'gol -> fly to Stonard -> the Swamp of Sorrows'
# 43-45 quests (the scroll, the Pool of Tears, Misty Reed Post, the murlocs) -> Stonard.
#
# Turned in here from the first visit: Skullsplitter Tusks (209) and Venture Company Mining (600).

