step The Bloodsail ships
  tip Optional: the scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the decks of the three ships off the Wild Shore, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs. Take it only if you can pull the crew to the rail one at a time, or with a friend; its chain runs on through the Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands.
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle" optional
  accept 624 optional                   -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Witch Doctor Unbagwa
  tip Take the road north out of Booty Bay; Unbagwa sits on a hill in Mistvale Valley, east of the road.
  accept 349                          -- Inside Spirit Den

step Mistvale gorillas
  tip The gorillas roam the valley around Unbagwa. The elders drop the giblets; any of them can drop a fang.
  collect 2799 quest 349.1
  collect 3862 quest 571 @33.0,66.1 map 1434

