step The Mind's Eye
  when group 591
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Mai'Zoth (level 47 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Two elite caster guards, around level 45, stand with Mai'Zoth and join the fight together with him.
  collect 3616 quest 591.1 @52.9,27.6 map 1434 group 2 -- Below ground

